{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1016823854"}, "name":{"label":"jdawgszeto"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-05T15:07:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"135"}, "id":{"label":"12856980770"}, "title":{"label":"extremely poor customer service"}, "content":{"label":"I purchased a whole year of Quittr subscription with the intention of using it to track my progress of quitting and have it act as a blocker onto my macbook. As it turns out, Quittr is not compatible for Macbook yet. I thought no matter, I could just email their customer services and request a refund because they aren’t giving the services I was looking for. I did get a reply initially but it was very lackluster. All they said was that the app is not compatible with Macbook. I sent three follow up emails to no avail. They are not transparent to their customers. If you do decide to pay for their subscription, be ready to stick, because they don’t care about refunding to you. I also tried refunding through my apple subscriptions. But it only shows my purchase of the free app, not the subscription. I can’t even ask them about why it’s not there, because it’s not like they’re going to respond. Such a shame that it made journey to quitting so much worse.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
