{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id653484739"}, "name":{"label":"orangebagel13253737"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-17T16:42:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"93.0"}, "id":{"label":"12197186565"}, "title":{"label":"Why do I have to pay?"}, "content":{"label":"Why am I being forced to pay almost $20 a month to get rid of an addiction. I get you have to make money but the fact you don’t even offer a free version for those who can’t afford it is sad. This is addiction we’re talking about. Something that deteriorates the mental health and social lives of millions of people around the world. Forcing people to pay for something like that is sad. I will be sticking to “I am sober”, they offer a premium version for those who want it but the free version of it works just as well for those who can’t afford", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
